# The preset (tape): a dotted eighth (P1 136, 377 ms at 120 BPM) with a few darkening ping-pong repeats. Clicks on
# every half bar, dry plus echoes (pan 128).
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 3
track fx1
input impulse 8 0.5
param p1 136
param p2 110
param pan 128
param level 255
gain 1
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below -0.5
